<title>GREECE: GREEK PM MEETS CENTRAL BANK GOVERNOR AT 1130 LOCAL.</title>
<headline>GREEK PM MEETS CENTRAL BANK GOVERNOR AT 1130 LOCAL.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's Prime Minister Costas Simitis is meeting with Bank of Greece Governor Lukas Papademos in Megaron Maximou at 1130 local to discuss the economy, the premier's office told Reuters. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
